{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Bunny Hop Hop",
    "steam_appid": 3292830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/ae954673bffa821966d4d88df3ffdae2.avif?t=1755289257\" data-has-big width=800 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny Hop Hop</strong> is a super cute and energetic game where you play as Bunny the rabbit, on a mission to help clear the sky of a strange, spreading pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from cube to cube to color them and clean up the sky. Once all the cubes are ready, make them explode and escape to the next area. <strong>But be careful!</strong> The pollution has started to affect the local creatures. Evil foxes, angry hail, and wild monkeys will try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/e08bf136ef17e3ccc972e533e72840cd.poster.avif?t=1755289257\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/e08bf136ef17e3ccc972e533e72840cd.webm?t=1755289257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Luckily, you're not alone. You can collect carrots and playful weapons to help you along the way. Some clouds are your friends, and they\u2019ll help you reach safety when things get tough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/61f6a90495edd9fa7af80ca73a26dde2.poster.avif?t=1755289257\" width=600 height=317 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/61f6a90495edd9fa7af80ca73a26dde2.webm?t=1755289257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a colorful, chaotic arcade-style adventure where every level brings you closer to restoring the skies and saving a world that\u2019s still full of hope and cuteness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ levels to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Biomes and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Console control, keyboard or mouse Input (Steam Deck being verified!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Score feature</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/ae954673bffa821966d4d88df3ffdae2.avif?t=1755289257\" data-has-big width=800 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bunny Hop Hop</strong> is a super cute and energetic game where you play as Bunny the rabbit, on a mission to help clear the sky of a strange, spreading pollution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump from cube to cube to color them and clean up the sky. Once all the cubes are ready, make them explode and escape to the next area. <strong>But be careful!</strong> The pollution has started to affect the local creatures. Evil foxes, angry hail, and wild monkeys will try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/e08bf136ef17e3ccc972e533e72840cd.poster.avif?t=1755289257\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/e08bf136ef17e3ccc972e533e72840cd.webm?t=1755289257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Luckily, you're not alone. You can collect carrots and playful weapons to help you along the way. Some clouds are your friends, and they\u2019ll help you reach safety when things get tough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/61f6a90495edd9fa7af80ca73a26dde2.poster.avif?t=1755289257\" width=600 height=317 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292830/extras/61f6a90495edd9fa7af80ca73a26dde2.webm?t=1755289257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a colorful, chaotic arcade-style adventure where every level brings you closer to restoring the skies and saving a world that\u2019s still full of hope and cuteness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ levels to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Biomes and more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Console control, keyboard or mouse Input (Steam Deck being verified!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local Score feature</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hop across floating cubes to bring color back to the polluted sky. Avoid enemies or take them down if needed. They've been affected by the pollution and will do anything to stop you from completing your mission! Collect carrots and grab weapons to help you along the way as you work to clean the sky!",
